Bind Npc 16056 Zone 2

On greeting
    If quest 220 is started and player has 910055000
        Say "I'm the Searcher of Keys, the guardian of the sixth key! You are qualified to answer the question since you possess the [Fifth Key]. Do you want to hear it?"
        Topic "Accepted" do
            Say "Who was created out of confusion?"
            Topic "Cypher " do
                Transaction
                    Take 1 of 910055000
                    Say "Your answer is incorrect. Your [Fifth Key] has been consumed as penalty. I will leave now in search of the secret of the keys."
            Topic "Logos" do
                Transaction
                    Take 1 of 910055000
                    Give 1 of 910056000
        Topic "Rejected" goto close
    Else if quest 220 is started
        Say "I'm the Searcher of Keys, the guardian of the sixth key! I only pose the question to those who bring the [Fifth Key]."
    Else
        Say ""
